  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing growth, good health and nutrition status of stunted children through locally-manufactured, soy-based fermented products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the development cooperation is to enhance growth, good health and nutrition status of stunted children, through the dual outcomes of using soy-based fermented products to improve the digestive health of stunted children age 24-59 months, and ensuring these SBFP&#xb4;s are locally available and appropriately used in rural communities.</narrative>
  </description>
